.Dd July 28, 2026
.Dt WAR_ROOM 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm war-room
.Nd generate reports from Rancher image-scanning database
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Ar command
.Op Ar arguments
.Op Fl options
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
is a command line utility for generating reports and visualizations from the
Rancher Image-Scanning vulnerability database.

The utility provides a collection of pre-built reports for examining container
images, vulnerabilities, packages, releases, and teams.

The location of the SQLite database is specified using the
.Ev CVE_DB_PATH
environment variable.

.Pp
Example:

.Bd -literal -offset indent
export CVE_DB_PATH=/path/to/cves.db
.Ed

.Sh COMMANDS
.Bl -tag -width Ds

.It Cm list
Display information about available resources.

Supported list targets are:

.Bl -bullet -compact
.It
images
.It
teams
.It
releases
.It
reports
.It
severities
.El

.It Cm report
Execute one of the built-in reports.

Available reports include:

.Bl -bullet
.It
top-images-by-vuln-count
.It
images-vulns-by-severity
.It
vulns-by-team
.It
vulns-by-all-teams
.It
images-by-cve
.It
release-debt
.It
release-health
.It
release-stats-by-release
.It
worst-packages
.It
packages-with-upgrades
.It
vex-effectiveness
.El

.El

.Sh OPTIONS

The following options are accepted by one or more reports.

.Bl -tag -width "--severity"

.It Fl t , Fl -team Ar team
Specify a Rancher team.

.It Fl s , Fl -severity Ar severity
Specify a vulnerability severity.

Valid values are:

.Bl -bullet -compact
.It
critical
.It
high
.It
medium
.It
low
.El

.It Fl c , Fl -cve Ar identifier
Specify a CVE identifier.

.It Fl r , Fl -release Ar release
Restrict a report to a specific release.

.It Fl p , Fl -package Ar package
Restrict a report to a package.

.It Fl l , Fl -limit Ar number
Limit the number of rows returned by a report.

.It Fl t , Fl -team Ar team
Team name.

.It Fl n , Fl -newest Ar newest
Newest only.

.El

.Sh REPORTS

.Bl -tag -width "packages-with-upgrades"

.It Cm top-images-by-vuln-count
Displays the images with the highest total vulnerability count.

.It Cm images-vulns-by-severity
Displays images filtered by vulnerability severity.

Requires
.Fl -severity .

.It Cm vulns-by-team
Displays vulnerability totals for a specific team.

Requires
.Fl -team .

.It Cm vulns-by-all-teams
Displays vulnerability totals grouped by all teams.

.It Cm images-by-cve
Lists images affected by a specific CVE.

Requires
.Fl -cve .

.It Cm release-debt
Displays release vulnerability debt.

If no release is specified, results for all releases are displayed.

Lower debt values indicate healthier releases.

.It Cm release-health
Displays a release health score.

If no release is specified, all releases are included.

Higher health values indicate healthier releases.

.It Cm worst-packages
Displays packages contributing the greatest vulnerability count.

The number of rows may be limited with
.Fl -limit .

.It Cm packages-with-upgrades
Displays vulnerable packages that have newer versions available.

May be filtered by package name and limited using
.Fl -package
and
.Fl -limit .

.It Cm vex-effectiveness
Displays VEX effectiveness metrics.

May be filtered by package name.

.El

.Sh ENVIRONMENT

.Bl -tag -width CVE_DB_PATH

.It Ev CVE_DB_PATH
Absolute path to the SQLite vulnerability database.

This variable must be set before executing
.Nm .

.El

.Sh EXIT STATUS

.Ex -std

.Sh EXAMPLES

List available reports:

.Bd -literal -offset indent
war-room list reports
.Ed

List teams:

.Bd -literal -offset indent
war-room list teams
.Ed

Display images with critical vulnerabilities:

.Bd -literal -offset indent
war-room report images-vulns-by-severity \
    --severity critical
.Ed

Generate a report for a specific team:

.Bd -literal -offset indent
war-room report vulns-by-team \
    --team observability
.Ed

Show all images affected by a CVE:

.Bd -literal -offset indent
war-room report images-by-cve \
    --cve CVE-2026-12345
.Ed

Show the twenty worst packages:

.Bd -literal -offset indent
war-room report worst-packages \
    --limit 20
.Ed

Show package upgrades:

.Bd -literal -offset indent
war-room report packages-with-upgrades \
    --package openssl
.Ed

.Sh DIAGNOSTICS

.Nm
prints descriptive error messages to standard error when:

.Bl -bullet
.It
a required subcommand is omitted
.It
an invalid report name is supplied
.It
an invalid severity is specified
.It
a required option is missing
.It
the report engine cannot be initialized
.El

.Sh IMPLEMENTATION NOTES

.Nm
is implemented as a command dispatcher built on
.Xr librattler 3
and presents report output as formatted terminal tables using
.Xr libfort 3 .

The report generation logic is implemented by the internal reporting engine.

